  title: 'MediShield Life and Universal Coverage (2015) '
  info: 'MediShield Life replaced MediShield, offering lifelong, universal health
    insurance coverage for all Singaporeans, regardless of pre-existing conditions.
    Subsidies increased for lower-income citizens.  Private insurers collaborated
    with MediShield Life to provide Integrated Shield Plans, offering additional
    coverage for private hospitals and better-class wards in public hospitals.  '
